obs r1 built GREEN first pass. Three scenes: the migration crux (moved world changes host, keeps byte-identical position; stayed world keeps both), the teeth (receive() refuses FreightTampered when a flipped fact byte makes the rebuilt order-head disagree with the advertised head; honest freight accepts), and distinctness (each world's order-head its own, no cross-wiring).
